  "题目1": "【听力】听录音，回答问题：说话人说电脑怎么了？\n听：My computer malfunctioned during the test.\nA. 被偷了\nB. 很新\nC. 出了故障\nD. 没电了",
  "题目2": "【单项选择】选出最恰当的一项。\n题干：The machine stopped because of a ______.\nA. malfunctioned\nB. malfunctioning\nC. malfunctions\nD. malfunction\n考点：变形",
